{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29365","headline":"令狐八拾遗见招送裴十四归华州 · 李商隐","name":"令狐八拾遗见招送裴十四归华州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十中郎未足希，骊驹先自有光辉。\n兰亭讌罢方回去，雪夜诗成道韫归。\n汉苑风烟吹客梦，云台洞穴接郊扉。\n嗟予久抱临邛渴，便欲因君问钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}